<title>GERMANY: Wella details 1996 full-year results.</title>
<headline>Wella details 1996 full-year results.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   78.0    vs 74.2</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    154.78  vs 143.7</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,832   vs 3,525</p>
<p>    Dividend on ordinary shares	    13	vs 13 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend on preference shares	  14	vs 14 marks</p>
<p>    Group net interest costs	(loss) 19.43   vs 40.5 (loss)</p>
<p>    Group DVFA earnings per share	  38 dmk  vs 26 dmk</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  60.6    vs 57.8</p>
<p>    Group fixed asset investments	  126.1   vs 121.3</p>
<p>    Group depreciation			  93.1   vs 88.2</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		    1,085   vs 1,052</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    16,000  vs 16,500</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German haircare and cosmetics group is WELLA AG.</p>
</text>
